<title>GERMANY: BUDERUS 9-MO PRE-TAX PROFIT UP 9 PCT.</title>
<headline>BUDERUS 9-MO PRE-TAX PROFIT UP 9 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>WETZLAR, Germany 1997-08-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Nine months to June 30 (fiscal years runs from October 1 to September 30)</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group pre-tax profit		     131     vs 120</p>
<p>    Group sales				  2,293   vs 2,287</p>
<p>    Group investments			  72	vs 98</p>
<p>    Group writedowns			   87	vs 95</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German enginerring group is Buderus AG. The company also said it was confident that sales and earnings would in the full-year 1996/1997 will exceed the previous year's results. The forecast did not take into account income from the sale of its aircraft equipment business, Buderus said.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
